If a patient is an opioid-naive-patient and has an acute-pain and an opioid-use-minimizing-strategy is possible then every clinician should implement the opioid-use-minimizing-strategy for the patient.
If a patient is an opioid-tolerant-patient and has an acute-pain and an opioid-use-minimizing-strategy is possible then every clinician should implement the opioid-use-minimizing-strategy for the patient.
